sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Gateway as Safety Gateway
    participant Ledger as Attempt & Effect Ledger
    participant MockPay as Mock Payment Service
    participant Recon as Active Reconciliation

    Gateway->>Ledger: Record Attempt 1 (State: SUBMITTED)
    Gateway->>MockPay: POST /refunds (Amount: ₹1,500, Order: ORD-204)
    Note over MockPay: Mock executes refund internally,<br/>but HTTP connection drops!
    MockPay--xGateway: Network Timeout (Connection Dropped)

    Gateway->>Ledger: Update Attempt 1 (Status: UNKNOWN)
    Gateway->>Ledger: State Transition (SUBMITTED -> UNKNOWN -> RECONCILING)
    Note over Gateway: DO NOT RETRY IMMEDIATELY!<br/>Must reconcile external state first.

    Gateway->>Recon: Trigger Active Reconciliation Loop
    Recon->>MockPay: GET /refunds?order_id=ORD-204
    MockPay-->>Recon: 200 OK [ { provider_ref: ref_sim_881, amount: 1500, status: COMPLETED } ]

    Recon->>Recon: Compare Discovered Effect with Authorization Bounds
    Note over Recon: Exact match discovered!<br/>Execution succeeded before network drop.
    Recon->>Ledger: Record Verified Effect (ref_sim_881, ₹1500, COMPLETED)
    Recon->>Ledger: Mark Attempt 1 COMPLETED
    Recon->>Ledger: Mark Intent INT-001 COMPLETED
    Note over Gateway,Recon: Safe Resolution: Zero duplicate payout generated!
